"Floaty or fullscreen" = "Floaty ko cikakken allo";
"Pick the layout that fits the moment. Floaty hovers above your desktop, while fullscreen feels like classic Launchpad." = "Zaɓi tsarin da ya dace da lokacin. Floaty yana shawagi a saman teburinka, yayin da cikakken allo ke kama da Launchpad na gargajiya.";
"Floaty mode" = "Yanayin Floaty";
"A panel that stays light and quick. Hide the Dock icon if you want a minimal feel." = "Allon da ya kasance mai sauƙi da sauri. Boye gumakan Dock idan kana son ƙaramar fuska.";
