"Fill the screen for a focused, grid-first workflow." = "Cika allon don aiki mai da hankali da tsarin grid.";
"Flip instantly" = "Canza nan take";
"Add a layout toggle shortcut in Settings to jump between modes anytime." = "Ƙara gajeriyar hanya don canza tsarin cikin Saituna domin ka koma tsakanin yanayi kowane lokaci.";
"Hotkeys you control" = "Makullai masu zafi da kake sarrafawa";
"Launchy ships with Cmd+Shift+Space, but you can set your own shortcuts in Settings > Keyboard." = "Launchy yana zuwa da Cmd+Shift+Space, amma zaka iya saita makullai naka a Saituna > Maballin.";
"Toggle Launchy anywhere" = "Canza Launchy daga ko'ina";
"Record the shortcut you want to open or hide the launcher." = "Rubuta gajeriyar hanya da kake son buɗe ko ɓoye masu sarrafawa.";
"Layout toggle" = "Maballin canza tsarin";
"Set an optional hotkey to swap floaty and fullscreen on demand." = "Saita makulli na zaɓi don sauya tsakanin Floaty da cikakken allo bisa bukata.";
"Reset friendly" = "Sake saiti mai sauƙi";
"Use Reset in Settings if you ever want the defaults back." = "Yi amfani da Sake saiti a Saituna idan kana son komawa ga tsoffin zaɓuɓɓuka.";
